  "goodToKnow": "Der Trottel is an informal word for an idiot or fool: So ein Trottel! It's mild enough to use about yourself: Ich Trottel! (silly me!). Trottelig means dopey or doddery, often of older people. It's common in Austria too. Calling someone a Trottel to their face is rude and, as with all insults, could technically count as a Beleidigung. Milder words include Dussel or Schussel; stronger ones are best avoided. Plural: die Trottel."
